            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at The Thai Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Per H\nCopenhagen, Denmark790 contributions\n0\nA little disappointed\nMar 2024 • Couples\nI love green curry and I had high expectations with authentic food and experienced chef. I have eaten green curry a lot and it’s always spicy but not here. I had to ask for chili to spice it up and even with that I never got that lovely feeling when you sweat a little. My wife got a different dish and she found it spicy. That being said there are an overwhelming amount of waiters and staff in general, counted 10 not including the kitchen and they almost fell over each other. Basically just as much staff as patrons. It still didn’t make things faster.\nRead more\nWritten March 1, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
