            "review_title": "Review at The Thai Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Scottttie\n45 contributions\n1\nWORST thai food and service ever\nOct 2021 • Couples\nThe worst thai food ever. Tasteless. Small size meals. No running water upstairs to wash hands or use the toilets. You’re kidding right. Charge you for refresher napkins. The owners of this place should be ashamed of themselves. Couldn’t pay by card so what happens if you don’t have cash? Got a takeaway green curry. NO RICE ? Had three tiny pieces of chicken in it and was a faded yellow colour. Tasted like dish water. Lucky there’s no OH&S in these Asian countries cause they’d be shut down immediately - excluding Japan. Disgraceful. I flushed the take away dish water curry down the toilet.\nRead more\nWritten October 19, 2021",
            "rating": 5.0,
